{"id": "s-0451", "domain": "brewery", "names": ["Malt", "Kettle", "Tank"], "text": "Beer first: the Malt goes into the Kettle and then into the Tank. Connect them with arrows. The Kettle is a big orange circle, and the Tank is a navy hexagon. Hey, is the Tank reachable from the Malt?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Malt,Kettle,Tank", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Kettle", "shape": "circle", "size": "large", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tank", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Malt"}}]}
{"id": "s-0452", "domain": "mars rover", "names": ["Rover", "Base", "Crater"], "text": "Rover drives from the Base to the Crater and returns. Please use one two-way arrow between Base and Rover, and a dashed arrow from Rover to Crater. Make the Rover tiny and red. Put the Crater far to the right.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Base", "to": "Rover", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Rover", "to": "Crater", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rover", "size": "tiny", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Crater", "position": "right"}}]}
{"id": "s-0453", "domain": "cathedral", "names": ["Nave", "Altar", "Tower"], "text": "Altar sits at the east end, which for me is the right side, and the Tower at the left. Move them there. The Nave is in the middle and huge. Paint the Altar gold. Which is the biggest of all?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Altar", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tower", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Nave", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Nave", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Altar", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0454", "domain": "language", "names": ["Subject", "Verb", "Object"], "text": "in a sentence the Subject comes before the Verb and the Verb before the Object. connect them like that please with arrows. Subject red, Verb green, Object blue, like the textbook. Whats the position of the Verb?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Subject,Verb,Object", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Subject", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Verb", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Object", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Verb", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0455", "domain": "vending", "names": ["Slot", "Bin"], "text": "Insert coins in the Slot, snacks fall into the Bin. Draw an arrow from Slot to Bin. Also put a yellow diamond named Check between them, and run Slot to it and it to Bin. Actually, remove the direct arrow from Slot to Bin.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Slot", "to": "Bin"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "color": "yellow", "name": "Check", "position": "between", "anchor": "Slot,Bin"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Slot,$new,Bin", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Slot", "to": "Bin"}}]}
{"id": "s-0456", "domain": "farm co-op", "names": ["Wheat", "Corn", "Barn"], "text": "All squares should be gold from now on, grain is gold. Create a square called Oats under the Wheat. Make Corn gold too, it's already a square I think. Then list all gold shapes.", "wires": [{"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "square", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "name": "Oats", "position": "below", "anchor": "Wheat"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Corn", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0457", "domain": "film set", "names": ["Camera", "Actor", "Boom"], "text": "Camera points at the Actor, Boom hovers above the Actor. So put the Boom above the Actor and draw a dotted arrow from the Camera to the Actor. The Actor is a big pink circle. Is the Camera the farthest from the Actor?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Boom", "position": "above", "anchor": "Actor"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Camera", "to": "Actor", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Actor", "shape": "circle", "size": "large", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Actor", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0458", "domain": "social", "names": ["Post", "Like", "Share"], "text": "Post gets Likes and Shares, so Post connects to Like and to Share. Make the Like a red star, and Share a blue circle. Duplicate the Like three times, popular post! How many stars exist now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Post", "to": "Like,Share"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Like", "shape": "star", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Share", "shape": "circle", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Like", "count": "3"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "star"}}]}
{"id": "s-0459", "domain": "hospital", "names": ["Bed", "Monitor", "Pump"], "text": "A patient Bed has a Monitor and a Pump. Draw plain lines from the Bed to each. Make Monitor green and Pump yellow. Hmm, and shift the Pump to the left by 45 pixels. Which one is the bottommost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bed", "to": "Monitor,Pump", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Monitor", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pump", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Pump", "direction": "left", "distance": "45"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "bottommost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0460", "domain": "rail freight", "names": ["Yard", "Siding", "Depot"], "text": "The Yard sends wagons to the Siding, the Siding to the Depot. Chain them with arrows. Put everything in a row and make the Yard huge. By the way, how many connections exist?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Yard,Siding,Depot", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Yard", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0461", "domain": "kid's drawing", "names": ["Sun", "House"], "text": "Okay my niece wants this: the Sun is a big yellow circle in the top left. The House is a red square at the bottom. Add three small green triangles, those are trees, near the House. Do you know how many triangles there are, then?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sun", "shape": "circle", "size": "large", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sun", "position": "topLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "House", "shape": "square", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "House", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "size": "small", "color": "green", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "House"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "triangle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0462", "domain": "it helpdesk", "names": ["User", "Bot", "Agent"], "text": "The User first talks to the Bot, and only if needed to the Agent. Connect User to Bot with a solid arrow and Bot to Agent with a dashed one. Colour the Bot teal and the Agent orange. Is the Agent connected to the User?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "User", "to": "Bot"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bot", "to": "Agent", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bot", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Agent", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Agent", "anchor": "User"}}]}
{"id": "s-0463", "domain": "solar", "names": ["Mercury", "Venus", "Earth", "Mars"], "text": "Arrange the four inner planets in a row, with Mercury at the left. Mercury is tiny, Venus and Earth are small, Mars is tiny too. Colour Mars red. And hmm, make Earth blue. Which is the rightmost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Mercury,Venus,Earth,Mars", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mercury", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Venus,Earth", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mars", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mars", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Earth", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0464", "domain": "gift exchange", "names": ["Santa", "Elf1", "Elf2"], "text": "Santa tells Elf1 and Elf2 what to build. Two arrows. Santa is red and huge. Elves are green and small, they look cute. Create a gold star named Gift between the elves and join each elf to it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Santa", "to": "Elf1,Elf2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Santa", "color": "red", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Elf1,Elf2", "color": "green", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "gold", "name": "Gift", "position": "between", "anchor": "Elf1,Elf2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Elf1,Elf2", "to": "$new"}}]}
{"id": "s-0465", "domain": "code", "names": ["Parser", "Lexer", "Emitter"], "text": "Lexer feeds Parser, Parser feeds Emitter, as in any compiler. Use arrows. Can you move the Lexer to the left and the Emitter to the right? Make the Parser a purple diamond. Is there a path from Lexer to Emitter?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lexer,Parser,Emitter", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lexer", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Emitter", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Parser", "shape": "diamond", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Lexer", "to": "Emitter"}}]}
{"id": "s-0466", "domain": "school trip", "names": ["Bus", "Museum", "Park"], "text": "The Bus takes kids to the Museum and then to the Park. Chain it. Make the Museum a big gray rectangle and the Park a lime ellipse. Please don't forget to put the Bus at the bottom. Where's the Park?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bus,Museum,Park", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Museum", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Park", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bus", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Park", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0467", "domain": "minimal", "names": ["One", "Two", "Three"], "text": "Swap One and Three. Colour Two black. Send One to the back and Three to the front. List the shapes that are not black.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "One,Three"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Two", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "One"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Three"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "notColor": "black"}}]}
{"id": "s-0468", "domain": "minimal", "names": ["Hub", "S1", "S2", "S3"], "text": "Arrange S1, S2 and S3 in a circle around the Hub, then link the Hub to each with plain lines. Colour all spokes teal. Hub is a huge gold star. Is the Hub the most connected?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "S1,S2,S3", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Hub", "to": "S1,S2,S3", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "S1,S2,S3", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hub", "shape": "star", "size": "huge", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0469", "domain": "bank", "names": ["Atm", "Core", "Audit"], "text": "Atm talks to the Core, Core talks to the Audit log. Wire them using dotted arrows. Hmm, the Core must be black and large. Redo the last step... no, never mind. Describe the diagram.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Atm,Core,Audit", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Core", "color": "black", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
{"id": "s-0470", "domain": "learning", "names": ["Lecture", "Homework", "Exam"], "text": "The Lecture comes before the Homework and the Homework before the Exam. Link them. The Exam is a huge red diamond. Shrink the Homework, we hate it. Is the Exam bigger than the Lecture?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lecture,Homework,Exam", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Exam", "shape": "diamond", "size": "huge", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Homework"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Exam", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Lecture"}}]}
{"id": "s-0471", "domain": "garden party", "names": ["Table", "Chair", "Lantern"], "text": "Put 4 small brown squares around the Table, those are chairs. Colour the Lantern yellow and place it above the Table. And I'd like to know, is the Lantern above the Table?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "small", "color": "brown", "count": "4", "position": "near", "anchor": "Table"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lantern", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lantern", "position": "above", "anchor": "Table"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Lantern", "position": "above", "anchor": "Table"}}]}
{"id": "s-0472", "domain": "streaming", "names": ["Camera", "Encoder", "Viewer"], "text": "Camera to Encoder to Viewer, that's the stream path. The arrows are solid. Put a red hexagon called Backup below the Encoder, joined to it by a dashed line. Is the Backup the nearest to the Encoder?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Camera,Encoder,Viewer", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "red", "name": "Backup", "position": "below", "anchor": "Encoder"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Encoder", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Encoder", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0473", "domain": "agriculture", "names": ["Seed", "Water", "Sun"], "text": "Seed needs Water and Sun, so both point at the Seed. Colour the Water blue, the Sun yellow. Seed is a green circle, small. Hm, and nudge the Sun up by 35 pixels. Is there anything green on the canvas?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Water,Sun", "to": "Seed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Water", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sun", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Seed", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sun", "direction": "up", "distance": "35"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0474", "domain": "engineering", "names": ["Load", "Beam", "Support"], "text": "The Load rests on the Beam and the Beam on the Support. Plain lines Load-Beam, Beam-Support. The Beam is a long rectangle, large. Put the Support at the bottom and the Load at the top. Is the Beam between them?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Load,Beam,Support", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Beam", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Support", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Load", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Beam", "position": "between", "anchor": "Load,Support"}}]}
{"id": "s-0475", "domain": "zoo", "names": ["Zebra", "Giraffe", "Hippo"], "text": "Giraffe is tall so make it large, Hippo is huge, Zebra is medium. Colours: Zebra white, Giraffe yellow, Hippo gray. Put them in a row. Which one is the smallest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Giraffe", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hippo", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Zebra", "size": "medium"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Zebra", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Giraffe", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hippo", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Zebra,Giraffe,Hippo", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0476", "domain": "approval flow", "names": ["Submit", "Manager", "Finance"], "text": "Submit, then Manager, then Finance. If the Manager rejects, it goes back, so connect Manager to Submit too. The Manager is a diamond. Finance is green. Are there cycles?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Submit,Manager,Finance", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Manager", "to": "Submit"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Manager", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Finance", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0477", "domain": "arctic", "names": ["Seal", "Bear", "Ice"], "text": "The Bear hunts the Seal, standing on the Ice. Put the Bear above the Ice and the Seal near the Ice. The Ice should be a huge white square. Draw an arrow from Bear to Seal.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bear", "position": "above", "anchor": "Ice"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Seal", "position": "near", "anchor": "Ice"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ice", "shape": "square", "size": "huge", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bear", "to": "Seal"}}]}
{"id": "s-0478", "domain": "band", "names": ["Singer", "Guitar", "Drums"], "text": "Singer in the center, Guitar left, Drums right, and the drums are a bit behind so send them to the back. Make the Singer pink. Duplicate the Guitar, we have two guitarists. Where is the copy?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Singer", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Guitar", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Drums", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Drums"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Singer", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Guitar"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "$new", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0479", "domain": "minimal", "names": ["M", "N"], "text": "M is a square, N is a circle. Both are red. Link M to N with a dashed arrow with the label \"link\". Is there a path from N to M? I assume not.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "M", "shape": "square"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "N", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "M,N", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "M", "to": "N", "style": "dashed", "label": "link"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "N", "to": "M"}}]}
{"id": "s-0480", "domain": "water park", "names": ["Slide", "Pool", "Lazy"], "text": "Slide ends in the Pool, and the Lazy river loops back to the Pool. Draw Slide to Pool and Lazy to Pool. Pool is blue and huge, Lazy is cyan. Move the Slide to the top right. Count how many are blue.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Slide,Lazy", "to": "Pool"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pool", "color": "blue", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lazy", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Slide", "position": "topRight"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "blue"}}]}
{"id": "s-0481", "domain": "robot arm", "names": ["Base", "Elbow", "Hand"], "text": "Base, Elbow and Hand form the arm. Connect the segments in order with plain lines. The Hand is a small star. Colour the Base gray. Set the Elbow to medium. What shape is the Hand?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Base,Elbow,Hand", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hand", "shape": "star", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Base", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Elbow", "size": "medium"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Hand", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0482", "domain": "seminar", "names": ["Speaker", "Slides", "Audience"], "text": "Speaker at the top, Slides in the middle, Audience at the bottom. Easy. Link the Speaker to the Slides and the Slides to the Audience. The Slides are a large white rectangle. Is the Audience the bottommost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Speaker", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Slides", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Audience", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Speaker,Slides,Audience", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Slides", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Audience", "position": "bottom"}}]}
{"id": "s-0483", "domain": "shipwreck", "names": ["Wreck", "Diver", "Boat"], "text": "The Diver goes down to the Wreck from the Boat. Boat to Diver, Diver to Wreck, dotted. Wreck at the bottom, Boat at the top. Make the Wreck black. Show me the neighbors of the Diver.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Boat,Diver,Wreck", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Wreck", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Boat", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wreck", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Diver"}}]}
{"id": "s-0484", "domain": "calendar", "names": ["Mon", "Tue", "Wed"], "text": "Put Mon, Tue and Wed in a row and spread them evenly. Mon is green, Tue is yellow, Wed is red. After that, delete Tue, the meeting got cancelled. How many are left?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Mon,Tue,Wed", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Mon,Tue,Wed", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mon", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tue", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wed", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Tue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0485", "domain": "ecosystem", "names": ["Owl", "Mouse", "Seed"], "text": "The Mouse eats the Seed and the Owl eats the Mouse. Seed to Mouse, Mouse to Owl, arrows please. The Owl is a big brown hexagon, the Mouse a small gray circle. Is the Owl the biggest shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Seed,Mouse,Owl", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Owl", "shape": "hexagon", "size": "large", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mouse", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0486", "domain": "warehouse", "names": ["Forklift", "Pallet"], "text": "Forklift picks up the Pallet. Connect them with an arrow. Add six tiny brown squares in a grid, they're the boxes. Everything that isn't brown should become gray. How many squares are there?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Forklift", "to": "Pallet"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "tiny", "color": "brown", "count": "6"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=square)", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(notcolor=brown,quantifier=all)", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "s-0487", "domain": "minimal", "names": ["Left", "Right", "Mid"], "text": "Left on the left, Right on the right, Mid between them. Colour Left blue, Right red, Mid purple. Tell me if Mid is nearest to Left.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Left", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Right", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Mid", "position": "between", "anchor": "Left,Right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Left", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Right", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mid", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Left", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0488", "domain": "cafeteria", "names": ["Tray", "Salad", "Soup"], "text": "The Tray carries the Salad and the Soup. Connect the Tray to both, plain lines. Salad green and Soup orange. Is the Soup bigger than the Salad?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tray", "to": "Salad,Soup", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Salad", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Soup", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Soup", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Salad"}}]}
{"id": "s-0489", "domain": "airline", "names": ["Pilot", "Copilot", "Cabin"], "text": "Pilot and Copilot both report to Cabin crew chief... call that Cabin. Arrows from Pilot and Copilot to the Cabin. Make both pilots navy. Now swap them, the seats were reversed. Which shapes are navy?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pilot,Copilot", "to": "Cabin"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pilot,Copilot", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Pilot,Copilot"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "navy"}}]}
{"id": "s-0490", "domain": "retail", "names": ["Aisle", "Till", "Door"], "text": "Door at the left, Aisle in the middle, Till at the right. Three arrows? No, two: Door to Aisle and Aisle to Till. The Till is a gold star. Oh, and the whole thing is tiny, so enlarge the Aisle.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Door", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Aisle", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Till", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Door,Aisle,Till", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Till", "shape": "star", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Aisle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0491", "domain": "experiment", "names": ["Control", "Test"], "text": "Control is blue and Test is red, to keep things clear. Put them side by side, Test to the right of Control. Make a small white circle called Result between them and connect both to it. Which shape is the nearest to the Result?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Control", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Test", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Test", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Control"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "white", "name": "Result", "position": "between", "anchor": "Control,Test"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Control,Test", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "$new", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0492", "domain": "games", "names": ["Pawn", "King"], "text": "Pawn is small, King is huge. Say the Pawn is white and the King black. Put the Pawn near the King. Then clear all rules and tell me the active rules afterwards.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Pawn", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "King", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Pawn", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "King", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Pawn", "position": "near", "anchor": "King"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "forget"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0493", "domain": "road trip", "names": ["Home", "Gas", "Hotel"], "text": "Home to Gas to Hotel, with dotted arrows since it's tentative. Make Home green and Hotel blue. Put Gas in the middle. Add a small yellow star named Fun near the Hotel. Is Gas between Home and Hotel?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Home,Gas,Hotel", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Home", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hotel", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Gas", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "size": "small", "color": "yellow", "name": "Fun", "position": "near", "anchor": "Hotel"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Gas", "position": "between", "anchor": "Home,Hotel"}}]}
{"id": "s-0494", "domain": "stage", "names": ["Light", "Sound", "Cue"], "text": "Cue triggers the Light and the Sound at once. Make arrows from the Cue to both. Colour the Light yellow and shrink the Sound to tiny. Since Cue triggers the most, is it the most connected thing?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Cue", "to": "Light,Sound"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Light", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sound", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0495", "domain": "plant", "names": ["Boiler", "Turbine", "Grid"], "text": "Boiler heats the steam, Turbine spins, Grid receives power. Boiler to Turbine to Grid. The Boiler is red and large. Turbine, a gray hexagon. Disconnect the Turbine from the Grid for maintenance, then list what the Grid touches.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Boiler,Turbine,Grid", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Boiler", "color": "red", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Turbine", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Turbine", "to": "Grid"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Grid"}}]}
{"id": "s-0496", "domain": "minimal", "names": ["Alpha", "Beta", "Gamma", "Delta"], "text": "Put Alpha, Beta, Gamma and Delta into a grid. Make Alpha and Beta green, Gamma and Delta orange. Swap Alpha with Delta. Which is the topmost shape now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Alpha,Beta,Gamma,Delta", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alpha,Beta", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Gamma,Delta", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Alpha,Delta"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "topmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0497", "domain": "puppet show", "names": ["Stage", "Puppet", "Curtain"], "text": "The Curtain hangs in front of the Stage; bring it to the front. Then place the Puppet right on the Stage, above it, and make it a pink star. When the show ends I'll delete everything, but not yet. Which shape is pink?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Curtain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Puppet", "position": "above", "anchor": "Stage"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Puppet", "shape": "star", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "pink"}}]}
{"id": "s-0498", "domain": "project", "names": ["Alpha", "Beta"], "text": "Alpha precedes Beta, so Alpha to Beta, one arrow. Then create a diamond named Gate between them, make it red, and route through it: Alpha to Gate, Gate to Beta. Remove the direct link, please. How many connections remain?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alpha", "to": "Beta"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "color": "red", "name": "Gate", "position": "between", "anchor": "Alpha,Beta"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alpha,$new,Beta", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Alpha", "to": "Beta"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0499", "domain": "museum cafe", "names": ["Counter", "Oven", "Fridge"], "text": "Counter is white, Oven is red, Fridge is cyan. Fix those. Put the Oven next to the Counter, the Fridge below the Counter. Is the Fridge below the Oven too? I'm planning the queue.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Counter", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Oven", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Fridge", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Oven", "position": "near", "anchor": "Counter"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fridge", "position": "below", "anchor": "Counter"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Fridge", "position": "below", "anchor": "Oven"}}]}
{"id": "s-0500", "domain": "finale", "names": ["Curtain", "Applause"], "text": "Last one for tonight. Make the Applause a huge gold star and put it at the center. Send the Curtain to the back and make it red. Shrink the Curtain a bit too. Thanks for all the work, and what is the biggest shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Applause", "shape": "star", "size": "huge", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Applause", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Curtain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Curtain", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Curtain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
